# .vercelignore (repo root)
# ==========================================
# This is a monorepo, but only `apps/web` is built by this Vercel project.
# The root directory is `apps/web`, and `apps/web` depends on
# `@lira/shared` via `file:../../packages/shared` (there is no workspace root).
# So `packages/` MUST stay in the upload or `npm ci` symlinks `@lira/shared` to a
# missing path and the build fails with "Can't resolve '@lira/shared'".
#
# Everything below is excluded purely to keep the upload small and the build
# deterministic — none of it is referenced by the storefront build.

.git
server
apps/mobile-manager
apps/mobile-user
apps/mobile-warehouse
apps/desktop-cashier
apps/web-admin
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
